{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - On 07/11/2024, the existing use of the main house as two self-contained flats was lawful within the meaning of Section 191(2) of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reasons:\r\nThe evidence supplied is sufficient to establish that on the balance of probabilities the main house at '44 Lichfield Road, Hounslow, TW4 6HS' has been used as a two separate self-contained flats, for an uninterrupted period of at least four years from the date of application, and would therefore be lawful under Section 171B of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended). \r\n"
  ],
